  "partial_reason": "a mid-stream break writes no PostgreSQL state at all: the execution stays 'executing' and the reservation is held. T07B recovery refuses it while the owning gateway is alive ('instance_alive'), so nothing bounds the hold until that process restarts. See the README finding F02-1.",
